    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Rasdinice.
* Travel to the {n:Allied Ensign} in {z:East Ronfaure (S)} at (G-5) (hug the left wall as soon as you come out).
** Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Everbloom Hollow}.
* Run forward to encounter a Soldier, who immediately runs towards a Trained Bat and begins attacking.
** During this time, you will see messages that display how much attention he is giving to the fight:
*** The soldier seems unfocused...
*** The soldier has begun training harder!
*** The soldier is fighting with vigor!
* Once the Trained Bat is defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** If the soldier never gains focus, you lose the mission.
* Return to {n:Rasdinice} for your reward.

=2 Notes
* The soldier will eventually die if left completely alone.
** The Soldier can also cure himself, and will do so reliably when falling under 70% HP.
* The Trained Bat lasts a long while, and seems to shift hate very often.

